@startuml
title Prediction Cards System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

actor "Prediction Participant" as Participant
actor "Service Operator" as Operator
actor "Integration/Test Operator" as TestOperator

package "Prediction Cards System" {

  package "Frontend Application" {
    component "Wallet-Connected Frontend\nPrediction API / Context Provider" as Frontend <<React>>
    component "Prediction Creation UI" as CreationUI
    component "Prediction Viewing UI" as ViewingUI
    component "Outcome NFT Operations UI\nfund, rent, withdraw, claim" as OpsUI
  }

  package "Backend Services" {
    component "Prediction-Processing Service" as PredictionProcessing <<scheduled>>
    component "Oracle Service" as OracleService <<Quarkus, scheduled>>
  }

  package "Aeternity Blockchain" {
    component "PredictionCards Smart Contract" as Contract <<Sophia>>
    component "AENS Name Resolution\ncontract location" as AENS
    component "Aeternity Wallet + SDK Client" as WalletSDK
  }

  package "External Systems" {
    component "External Price Provider" as PriceProvider
    component "Prediction Media Storage\nIPFS-compatible" as MediaStorage
  }

  package "Local Contract Integration-Test Environment" {
    component "Aeternity Test Node" as TestNode
    component "Compiler Service" as TestCompiler
    component "Index / Debug Endpoint" as TestIndex
    component "Test Proxy / CORS Configuration\nGET, POST, OPTIONS\nContent-Type, Cache-Control,\nContent-Range, Range" as TestProxy
  }
}

Participant --> Frontend : uses wallet-connected UI
Operator --> OracleService : configures/runs
Operator --> PredictionProcessing : configures/runs
TestOperator --> TestProxy : performs browser-style tests

CreationUI --> Frontend
ViewingUI --> Frontend
OpsUI --> Frontend

Frontend --> WalletSDK : wallet-mediated contract calls
Frontend --> AENS : resolve deployed contract name
Frontend --> Contract : create/read/fund/rent/withdraw/claim
Frontend --> MediaStorage : load outcome NFT media

WalletSDK --> Contract : submit Aeternity transactions

PredictionProcessing --> AENS : locate contract
PredictionProcessing --> Contract : initiate oracle query for closed predictions\ncomplete result processing

OracleService --> AENS : locate contract
OracleService --> Contract : check pending oracle queries\nsubmit oracle result response\nmaintain oracle registration/validity
OracleService --> PriceProvider : obtain external price data

Contract --> AENS : contract location mechanism

TestProxy --> TestNode : local integration access
TestProxy --> TestCompiler : local integration access
TestProxy --> TestIndex : local integration access
TestProxy --> Contract : local contract testing

note right of Frontend
  Provides prediction operation capabilities
  to child components through provider/context.
  Converts prediction time inputs to
  millisecond-level timestamps before submission.
end note

note bottom of OracleService
  Mandatory runtime configuration:
  keys, node/compiler connection,
  network, scheduling periods,
  oracle fees, validity-management.
end note

note bottom of Contract
  Maintains prediction, outcome NFT,
  fund/rental/withdrawal/reward state.
  Determines winning outcome and opens
  reward claiming after oracle response.
end note

note bottom of TestProxy
  CORS/proxy configuration is limited to the
  local contract integration-test environment.
end note

@enduml
